{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:576f377fce860e295ff106c07a591e78bdc6cc57daeb5d2a32911e7083453f30",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:434a364b006243be2eb1389a3bc31328e357b161e4fef296163bf7a2ca61e80e",
      "text": "始动，Jupiter！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bef4fea1302123c644348b2b067fa09f121f64575d57e736e43bb639adfd3be",
      "text": "在黑井社长的命令下，冬马、翔太、\n北斗三人组成了名为“Jupiter”的组合。\n在一边摸索了解彼此一边继续开展组合活动的某一天，\n他们要在历史悠久的音乐节目上展示出道单曲，然而……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_a:cmd-000019:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_a:cmd-000019:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:434a364b006243be2eb1389a3bc31328e357b161e4fef296163bf7a2ca61e80e",
      "text": "始动，Jupiter！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9269b056ac3fd80574cb426188249286a877e9211220d040f4d2321d92b9370d",
      "text": "你们就是Jupiter吧。黑井社长交代过让我严格\n锤炼你们，请多指教了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:033f7be18e9b9ff324ace80a37fa8967638f1712dc09a7bd36147111ac821d43",
      "text": "请多指教！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:263627eb4b8f529f155faa5bfb0a28773565301b2709ff3f57ff40529dd9566a",
      "text": "那么，赶紧开始舞蹈课程吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_a:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99703fc77a09a6ae21fb859636516167838470884c08db456bf64a15a0cbae3c",
      "text": "One、Two、Three、Four！\n很好！翔太君，动作很利落很棒哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_a:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6a7e399e0ef83b68a3c94a2e5be0c334bbba9a1df122fb3f62bd10d21e52faf",
      "text": "嘿嘿，对吧♪\n我的话……这种动作也是能做到的哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_a:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84f599a3bf3a8f413d9c916c3edb25625a368c42bda2a7c6a6a3a1f2570d8ff2",
      "text": "嘿……呀！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_a:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a22bbd287d0e6ecf4558fe424a8916090e01a8965bb799ec56e03001c029d5ba",
      "text": "（哇，那是什么动作！？\n又快又复杂，一瞬间脑子都卡壳了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_a:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a468af0d04f3e86040c8e394f1bd6c06d451f67569160bfb5f670c0aa7a028aa",
      "text": "（可恶，我光是记住舞步\n就竭尽全力了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_a:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94a78b907244dc1d2dd0746334bf16ab48444ad6d6612f3037ddc0b669c0ac2e",
      "text": "（这家伙不只是嘴上说说而已……但是，我也不会认输！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_a:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c767e9c27727b1c4cefc686c01207c7fcca44ff00e717dd852874b6643a8798c",
      "text": "（诶，这种时候居然还跟得上啊。\n挺能干的嘛）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_a:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f750b2be49b6e6e82cf923107ff566903b710fd56b5a3248222d777b62f541d4",
      "text": "……、……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_a:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed3cabb36b30f10622b1b01f619c7a90fa284bd82a9b7e4d98a570b06b20297a",
      "text": "（北斗君也意外地跟上来了呢。\n……“Jupiter”吗。说不定有点意思♪）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_b:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c710de22af2d5a9636c0d1f4b65c3da75cb1bbc836b3f6ef923b9d5b8acddf22",
      "text": "课程结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d2dbfbe119fdc28b8b9e219ff28eaefbeefd5e87d58a58899457f27a36e589b",
      "text": "三个人都辛苦了！\n明天也保持这个状态继续加油吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd8bdab38abff4165fdbc34d098522fb635ad5b27729b0d4871021ff0df11ea9",
      "text": "非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c521a402617be94fa629534adc91688ecb40c5ab08146c720f0c6a819bbea320",
      "text": "……对舞蹈的自信果然不是吹出来的啊。\n挺能干的嘛，翔太。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_b:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31bd6d6ee51ac0ed4851698b2ab58eef0434b4c6f738787f10b58d8253815c70",
      "text": "你那边也挺不错的嘛？\n嘛，不过大概永远都比不上我就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9d5df7b230493d076b5a23bfc283ab3599c0f08132c15b8dd247a6b2b91e577",
      "text": "真是的，嘴上真是不饶人啊。\n厉害的事情确实厉害，我承认就是了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_b:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15ab667537ecd01717df2d44f694c3ad7d710397c8db8eaf8c2a96461251b668",
      "text": "但总有一天，\n我绝对会把你甩在身后的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_b:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7159c7fc4b40540cf822293313332f9ecfc0b974d6d3c8440eb6efa9bfba023",
      "text": "冬马、翔太。打扰你们聊天不好意思啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_b:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9116c0db6b703594ba894c31c461afb68a45c915924e8c947e6666e71a488434",
      "text": "好像有巴士可以送我们回家，\n差不多该去换衣服了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_b:cmd-000114:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_b:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:537fe72a1ff4885482a72463b9b87294e8ddbfb2c466aea156677c6022b47bd5",
      "text": "呼……呼……呼噜……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_b:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13e48787706959b66ec3450eeea5401ecde8efd9d54e4280df2b4a5e712b260b",
      "text": "翔太。快到家了，该醒醒了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_b:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b73491dd41dccd412808f09fb6f2681bb9fac2c3916f84aefc655e3f3642680e",
      "text": "唔——……不要，再睡10分钟…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_b:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57cdd389e021a1c2bf36a859cac2d1f705addfe63f97b0877161d5f52a0ecbd6",
      "text": "不行啊，完全没有要醒的样子。\n……哎，聊着聊着好像已经到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_b:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5ea617bd49430da16ea6582f13b9a5a513c18d8880b0accb0ec76886c209136",
      "text": "这家伙，起床气也太重了吧……\n嗯？屋里有人出来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70ca9ea5d069ad65933d4b5779a4b874aa4b93313da8d5a45dd704e829badad8",
      "text": "真是的，翔太！好啦，快点起来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca901a7a9e1b21392b98749153cb2c1ab27056a5d86d5328d98018e72c58ddbe",
      "text": "唔——……姐姐……？\n我知道了啦……呼噜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24a91b5bd54f5ebf47dc6cdfa40177c54aaa54cc34d60508785b1c42fdae1996",
      "text": "不好意思，给你们添麻烦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7679077774123ca2c87201b93c97e228397cf0c89fa53b38cafcbed55728749d",
      "text": "不，是我们这边才对，让您特意到巴士来接他，\n真是抱歉。那么，他就交给您了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_c:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acb8220964ab776f42a36cd554dc143a8b758e21f22cf613b4c88bdf368bd3c4",
      "text": "真是的……明明跳舞最厉害，\n却是个这么让人操心的家伙。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_c:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5a5a602398fbebb49731b75d68c3d6518adfd5184e749653be8b550770bf04c",
      "text": "……呐，我一直挺好奇的。\n冬马为什么会想要当偶像呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_c:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f43c3b2fd3625444574d9d4b21f3f6ca67fcfb66e976d0d3fb58a1a1760d969",
      "text": "既然都参加比赛了，\n是对艺人或偶像怀有憧憬之类的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_c:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbbf3df9235baee572cb32137e075ef3955ec90814c554b0e435d9873f670bf8",
      "text": "不。我对偶像什么的，老实说毫无兴趣。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_c:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae97e110c0fc4bc85dfdc56c83dee9e0a8039eb200fc739d6e90639b0634c712",
      "text": "去参加比赛是因为跟朋友打赌，\n半开玩笑去报的名。然而……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_c:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7377adede0f4b923d21fea9cbb6d5bdcefa29914dd8f99d7113fe11726a2aa8b",
      "text": "拿到优胜的时候，感觉爽极了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_c:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9a7153b7294ff01ac5231d03de93905e573cc52e4a0eba9c4f4f5a4dd018f7c",
      "text": "在那之前，将来想成为什么、有什么目标，\n我全都没有……但那一次，让我热血沸腾了起来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_c:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:851c3c1e5faeda5378a5d0024d29fec89c7fcfec93cb7750a330c44ef96b967d",
      "text": "我便想着，要在偶像这个世界里战斗，\n成为第一名。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_c:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87246f2789a8c0e408b9e6358fdc1f4233f60f46b40c85a39a9dd10fe2f39cbc",
      "text": "那你呢？\n你又是为什么当偶像的？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_c:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:550dbc697826cfe66f9258731f69b55167a9b5c0ce4acd4cd5e0ad8b52ccc66d",
      "text": "我是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a001ce06a447efc4db64382d0fd0ef634040f5af3d1e47516ef11deb752ba5f2",
      "text": "感觉要是成了偶像，能被更多的女孩子们\n众星捧月般围着……吧☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8b0f6f0ae8d5bf234c2a0462a98640b8924ffc532a46aacdd651d89f6caedb9",
      "text": "哈……哈啊！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89b8c711c303be2c731c81a606711d8b4fb91e7bb03bbb09baee0cb24139be6a",
      "text": "哎呀，有那么值得惊讶吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_d:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6bf104223bfc66c208b050ea0cd2563b50bbb509db274d846e2185483978492",
      "text": "冬马不也多多少少\n希望能受女孩子欢迎吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_d:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8967866af7940bbb8158ec3b30d825942e330b092b2be389d6b4c06823283eb5",
      "text": "什……！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8400967d18275beede1192114aa5643786bf8a608af9a32f0e7e5345aff1b2f6",
      "text": "脸居然红成那样。难不成，\n你对女孩子没什么免疫力……啊，抱歉来电话了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_d:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ce488aef5aa005ddd697ddf02b71bfc605b09778cf9800152746646b046e715",
      "text": "喂？……呵呵，谢谢你的邀请。\n当然没问题哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_d:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87862d65fa0f6740d72dfdc4a77a87c18493de8f042f6a684a872761f8561452",
      "text": "我知道一家夜景很漂亮的餐厅。\n我马上就去预约。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_d:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e2f7fb33c0e0d8f24e324cfc5876a1e965592776af2a3189895a77199ce99a1",
      "text": "相信你一定会喜欢的。\n不过……比起夜景，你更加美丽哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_d:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94189670b0a067fa2dcf7298b030a9caba0e0be335e08c544292294d1d644047",
      "text": "（搞什么啊，那种轻浮的台词……！\n能这么若无其事地说出口，简直无法理解！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_d:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3be25fa32f392649014701c162f3ff11dc0cb76f37a6f59ba9fb91ec052fe0aa",
      "text": "（翔太我行我素，北斗是个搭讪狂。\n跟这两个家伙组队，真的没问题吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_e:cmd-000015:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:102ff1b7cb481553c8396dd6799d204aec96a73e1cc2997e6e2f0c58b93abf00",
      "text": "翔太的房间",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_e:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37eba61e31da664d28451c69cbe12a000261c27dfb693766cd4c728622b05107",
      "text": "呼……呼…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed887e9cd2e0fd51f2022f3e2e7ab6fb28c360c8cd48db80362f5427b5f348ab",
      "text": "翔太，今天不是有工作吗？\n快起床！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_e:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b77ec88362b15332e14e37f3af84d1055ee7af87b6a7942147f89825f1a9ddd5",
      "text": "好——……唔嗯……呼……呼……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_e:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:507133ec25182c177720698f23d2da003b7dfb6737f7d536207ddae9afeda6ed",
      "text": "喂——！不准钻回被窝里！\n快点起床去吃早饭——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_e:cmd-000051:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f64b622cb4d3914f85f1feb3b52adab22b8cb7e591fc8c195ddd41f086b0aa7",
      "text": "呐——……再给我一杯牛奶……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_e:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67ad5179c9582608657efe2041728d4e9ced1da52ddbc50a82a0b06d5099d544",
      "text": "诶？啊……真的，扣子扣错了……\n……嗯，谢谢姐姐。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_e:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28a5e3a499cae296c79bfa4c00e4783e8ef87f3f49d2889a04898944dd69ac80",
      "text": "没事的……我和冬马君还有北斗君，\n相处得挺好的……呼啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_e:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ac422d9dfd50adff64e45ec6113e2c94242dff02ada9b82436c8788f65ad758",
      "text": "翔太，接你的人来咯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_e:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d0b4e416aa48705ccab4c230ab11835a67f9372c42ce06e85f57b6b69bc889d",
      "text": "好——的，我走啦——……\n啊，忘拿包了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_e:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d7aa073ba8a3a63c87a2e2b8eccb95f818223296fdcc4de38faa96d3f0f5692",
      "text": "真是的，你在干嘛啊。\n好啦，我送你到巴士那里。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_e:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:128612388782630c9b6dd9a381ad575f7dc446a2c1d1d17b381d8b3860e56640",
      "text": "走咯，翔太！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_e:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77c12c9a8bc8801e43d2aa59bcf9130a1eb3a6af7d7cdb937eb6f73b3e010470",
      "text": "唔——……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_e:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b9421116c6f4558edb72cd11f309f0a654922656de48efe33a651d89b940e29",
      "text": "真是的……\n那孩子，这样真的没问题吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_f:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a69722a52140a35baacd4b05eb5017949cfc7ff9e748c6027673bd74a4e76df",
      "text": "翔太，小心脚下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_f:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec1fbb8d97f62027037cd6066000eac24361029cca989681efca9865253d5b00",
      "text": "我知道啦——……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_f:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6625941fd86380a2f6207b6d2779b4f2cb16b2ef20639b7da362964c0d715b63",
      "text": "抱歉啊。\n还让你们特地到家门口来接他。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_f:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cc8da0891458c03cd577f0822ae138c47470660f96faecd215da2ce28b8208c",
      "text": "请别在意。既然是同一个组合的\n成员，做到这种程度也是理所应当的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_f:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98f596ac913fcb4c8ad0f2ecba866765750f7ee21e1962eb4a1819ee8ed195e3",
      "text": "太感谢了！\n那翔太，路上小心哦——",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_f:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9b87824e3685478283aa63644a17b60a24ecf0e9b6cf8e827b72a47b818cdda",
      "text": "我走啦——……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_f:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62a1264d3be65248adb12f8b6031a8b4e8fe6f0893ea0d4ea73e29040ce27767",
      "text": "翔太的姐姐们，\n总是会有人出来送行呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_f:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:939fa959305423feb3c892187c298f09272a4f3fcc2426e0bca02c6d49cebd07",
      "text": "大家都很温柔，真是一群很棒的姐姐呢☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_f:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bd3449fef5aa0158fdfa2eaca200d5d3fd4632f2daa93911e4ec6be17c9c68d",
      "text": "这样吗……呼啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_f:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24dbeb974d2afa08f2c150231af251379b5c208ddcfb62af19ddb8b7a79ecac3",
      "text": "给我振作点啊，翔太！北斗你也别吊儿郎当的，\n赶紧确认今天的工作了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_g:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:318952463479eeed897b652797bfadcb5deb1be904e09bd19ca14f7aaa81fb51",
      "text": "不管怎么说，今天终于到了\n在音乐节目上公开出道单曲的日子了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_g:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c88c704553640777a4a65735216774fde7f97e68d476a6f5d8ea8b5b45bd83a",
      "text": "而且，还是历史悠久的音乐节目！\n一定要帅气地拿下，迈向顶峰的阶梯……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_g:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e06bb2ef8ab23fbd35b21b818fabba6b285fa1af21d5a2b8fa0df702170602a",
      "text": "是啊——\n……啊，北斗君，那个茶能给我喝一口吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_g:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8217ba9e6181747b673e341b97ebcaf0802f62a72a366f4f847a07e12b42b0dd",
      "text": "给。这里还有轻食，想吃的话请自便哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_g:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:554f5b850a2e552015b6d5aa39f58d76a7ac9ffa92a2891cae75888e69153742",
      "text": "哇，看起来很好吃的三明治。\n我才刚吃过早饭，等会儿再吃好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_g:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de725741921ff3e5f0eee6555787c64878db2fd76405eef85f42435cb32fa27e",
      "text": "喂！你们怎么这么优哉游哉啊。\n你们两个到底有没有点紧张感啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_g:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49a93b5e3df77631000f61b971adf09122e5b43e9449fd524234707548cdf86e",
      "text": "这种事情，太紧张了也不好吧？\n冬马君也放松，放松啦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_g:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8f8024429bd2357c50be2ccd9442774fc75a6d04a82d3cfde5ddad3ce956d37",
      "text": "嘛，虽然你说的也有道理啦……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_g:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6f045d71072ebb101c78364275f3020e1b6180e3a0f331ff24e21e9247d070d",
      "text": "？怎么了，冬马。一副心事重重的表情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_g:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76b1482c6b95513e5b85291ce846027525135b706a92dee60c5627c36db26aca",
      "text": "没……我们这种新人，真的能够\n突然登上那么厉害的节目吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_h:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c597e9d4470124ef97aaf6643015104dbb91ee230e88cf3363c9d4c2188c0a7c",
      "text": "“只要动用我的力量，这种事轻而易举！\n啊哈哈哈哈！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_h:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52025d2962749027d5ca9fad71703c0c778b9dc00d5a784bffeb88b9050ff4f4",
      "text": "……黑酱也是这么说的，\n应该是他做出了努力吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_h:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43dc2291903acec7b6b6305f52bd9082c07a9190a4d4616541f1767b202f75b9",
      "text": "也是啊……虽然一开始觉得他是个可疑的大叔，\n但该办的事确实都给办好了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_h:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bd0529c76f392d5eea2d85d1b6e4fc6882df8f822f7c0f0068b68b2bbc1e207",
      "text": "真不愧是961 Pro的社长。得好好谢谢他才行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_h:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ff470c84830748e8baadae0aaed019590fc7c8f0c8c6ea89a375fe1da973c9e",
      "text": "（说起来，之前正准备进休息室的时候……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_h:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac039f32d92ff456562ddd41e145e459779b1e142fe24c99bf551623792a9722",
      "text": "……承蒙关照了。\n关于那个……的事情……是的，没错。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_h:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b327e0caac3179a2561b7493e8c67d42435bab2b8ea6fad4da223f580a426021",
      "text": "是的呢……把那个偶像给……\n替换成……我们家的Jupiter，务必……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_h:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29b809bd2f72c4da9b26a4874926cc88a8713c5782ffa600ad4943a203dbeaab",
      "text": "（那个时候的电话，和这次的节目出演。\n是不是有什么联系，呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_h:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7907de90aeea32aad81b3265bace26f51adc8aeec309dab3013ac6bc9fdf54bf",
      "text": "……也是呢。\n今天就去俘获各位天使酱的心吧☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_h:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04ab3663ce0b3a52473c152b64dca27354d2744657b15d8a7e2cbdcd95d05e66",
      "text": "说什么呢。\n嘛，既然要做，我也绝对会拼尽全力的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_h:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d701cd97bde7dcdf056916fd3952092ac73d07f68b0db864c1266bdf034fc30",
      "text": "冬马君，太热血过头啦～\n不过，我也没打算偷懒就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_h:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eea0fe9da8962b1a3c7c9ea4fa1e5f6334cfb5a73e382b6fc75d822784cdb3d7",
      "text": "所以说……\n除了大获成功以外，别无可能对吧♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_i:cmd-000021:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:317229e91d6ba6c45fca0754c38138394d350a2ce70fd3adb92a0ba939ef01dc",
      "text": "数个月后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_i:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9551bfe410a06aeeb41acd3aed9b752778999312a620c9fe941934175b4a2c63",
      "text": "呵呵呵……真不愧是我们Jupiter。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_i:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8c4a4eb461d7aa7a01c07e99ec3d5277751acf59ae5bbeae56221996dbb2d04",
      "text": "披露了出道单曲的音乐节目，\n获得了巨大的成功……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_i:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbc7f092b2211fad98fe3402ef2de717b7eb33d8bd5a0be315a0be23495f281a",
      "text": "Jupiter的知名度水涨船高，\n一口气登上了巨星之位！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_i:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bae9f51f4d02b27d63b89d98ddbd7be1cea0f6f4474b9bb685dc6dbfce9d4a9a",
      "text": "之后发售的CD，也是一直\n稳坐月销量榜第1名的位置呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_i:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0fef7276277a8d0102e5b9b9b43f7946a5ff080651aa8a4be76857bb06e74123",
      "text": "我姐姐她们啊，\n每天都在听Jupiter的CD哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_i:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:373d8d48d83451a7ad85c0011a2944edfe59a1125b53b6edee5d09f625c9e15c",
      "text": "翔太的家人还是一如既往地感情融洽呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_i:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1fec084e15ace1c1443ff77b66cc998cacdf5cdd96f9cd6546b3c8aae0c30040",
      "text": "我在街上走的时候，被天使酱\n搭话的次数也比以前增多了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_i:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a56de6ba849e03c77a8bf73f621e7eee5a5cc2e67cbe0a5f99381718d810c141",
      "text": "我切身感受到大家都在热议我们呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_i:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5cf42b2d74a4e0945afb87635a36ca917a795f3ebbd682202513f13458fac91",
      "text": "是啊……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_i:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80e662d86ecbaebcb8f125981a456530ee6a4461050c5c51c5a791236cef7eab",
      "text": "拿到第1名这个数字固然让人高兴，但有那么多人听了我们的歌，\n才是最让我开心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_i:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3eaf85821eb1d75015aea5aa80b431e5f7cc7cb1520f5073067d41e9a807dec6",
      "text": "（经过练习，提升实力，并化作结果……\n做偶像，真的太快乐了！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_j:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e483fd6c0bac471cec034de18ca9e81e94dca1ff58e74315b30a2d4b6b5a9ca",
      "text": "你们只要按我说的去做就行了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_j:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c970743f78cd282affc639626ced8b04ecf0717217bd19883e2e44131c77a13a",
      "text": "噢！今后也拜托了啊，大叔！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_j:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d479b8bae386ec1713a48d97a87862143a3f9c18bc7af5ea9cf6c6b114f56991",
      "text": "（哎呀呀，真是天真单纯地高兴呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_j:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:230b486fab1b3c4be12fc4c688c527dcb3b5d4c44dee62cd0b2509862853726f",
      "text": "（冬马君他，到底知不知道\n黑酱暗中操纵了CD排行榜的事情呢——）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_j:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c951647c4ec4ac5b8498af6016a60739307ebfccc0e1719ba17b2219eb6f432",
      "text": "（北斗君又是哪一边呢？\n感觉像是知情的样子……嘛，算啦）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_j:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86980dc63e8c371fa7d023edab27fcd852271669c1b1dd688fc48e97f92c29d2",
      "text": "音乐节目的工作虽然也不错，\n但美食节目的工作之类也拜托了哦，黑酱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_j:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:252ef8f823530216dcfaf05383297de36b5e2645417e40798e6d1ca7357be571",
      "text": "能和迷人的天使酱共演的工作，\n我也想拜托一下呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_j:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a21c336ae9709c829c1efa5acc5153ae39d6e0df63e5cfc1ca429ef88896abc",
      "text": "你们两个啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_j:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5c26d917faa4775febefec4bdf3ba4f99f3ff12a5fd93fa5ee6b050d5057669",
      "text": "反正都要做，当然是开心的工作更好吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_j:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f7848ad0d5b1d25eb7d9f73203abeaef8b076841520cf11389c77d3592309fe",
      "text": "我也赞同翔太。反正都要做，\n能和天使酱在一起更好呢☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_j:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:878c1cd7303d9d4b29c07d0030b39794f7e29f3c73d144ca3470103736612bf0",
      "text": "真是的……不过嘛，不管什么工作都包在我们身上吧。\n如果是我们的话，小菜一碟！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
